# LightGBM model files are text-shaped but must be byte-exact -- CRLF
# conversion on a Windows checkout silently corrupts them (confirmed: a
# fresh `git clone` on this machine produced a 794726-byte file from a
# 789205-byte blob, and LightGBM then fails with "Model format error").
models/*.txt binary

# Parquet/CSV data files: also exact-byte, never worth line-ending mangling.
*.parquet binary
